
### 사진 가져오기
GET http://localhost:8080/api/photo-entries/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}}
Content-Type: application/json


### id로 사진 가져오기
GET http://localhost:8080/api/photo-entries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 범위 내의 사진 가져오기
GET http://localhost:8080/api/photo-entries?swLat=36&neLat=37&swLng=127&neLng=128
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}}
Content-Type: application/json
